<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>气血 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B0%94%E8%A1%80/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 13:35:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B0%94%E8%A1%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>十三论气血</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-26-lunqixue/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 13:32:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-26-lunqixue/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》附篇“十三论气血”，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;论述气与血在生理病理及治疗中的相互滋生关系。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;气无形，血有形。二者叠相生长，治血须理气，治气亦须理血。无形生有形（补气生血）用于危急，有形生无形（补血养气）用于平缓，气血两相须而两相得&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>